	(text "Two ports for sensors the universal channels suit badly: bridges (load cells, bare pressure sensors), RTDs, thermocouples, millivolt cells. Each has a differential pair straight into the ADS124S08 (port A: AIN8 / AIN9, port B: AIN10 / AIN11)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a84b5e7-c452-5b7f-ab66-a06c6a17600c")
	)
	(text "Inputs must stay between 0 V and 5 V. 2.2 k limits the current into the ADC to 3 mA with 12 V on a pin (10 mA allowed), so a wiring mistake does no damage; the reading of every ADC input is disturbed while it lasts. Excitation is off until PREC_EXC_EN is high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2d51d2a2-0f06-5087-9412-b2dffa527f8c")
	)
	(text "EXCITATION AS THE ADC REFERENCE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "374e6154-e93d-58eb-8fc9-c06853ee9eb0")
	)
	(text "EXCITATION (BOTH PORTS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5db5c97d-f1bb-54b1-8054-7be7ea6b40fe")
	)
	(text "PRECISION PORT B"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5fbe447d-d02f-5bb4-9d4e-a4e303efa413")
	)
	(text "BIAS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "74890e4e-2b3e-50d6-b789-34578ef467ef")
	)
	(text "PRECISION PORT A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83c8df0f-b05a-59f9-a436-d7ed6376b0be")
	)
	(text "Gain, the 10 uA-2 mA current sources, the thermocouple bias and burn-out detection are ADC register settings. The 5 V excitation also feeds REFP0 / REFN0, so a bridge read against that reference ignores drift in the 5 V rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ba9f52a5-1b30-5d20-acdd-755406ff8225")
	)
